# Tier-1: the core design library. A tag on this list promises the caller:
#   no domain type crosses its Props; no product word in its name; it names an
#   OBJECT, not a screen; it renders with no ambient CSS beyond baseStyle; and it
#   fetches nothing, routes nothing, reads no global but design tokens.
#
# Adding a line is the reviewable act of admission. A `std-` registration that is
# not on this list fails the Rebar charter check.
#
# Everything else in the tree is LEGACY: it keeps its name, and inherits none of
# the obligations above. A grandfathered string is not a claim about quality.
#
# Columns: tag <TAB> category <TAB> # source. The category is one of the eleven
# in std-charter.ts — the Astryx catalogue's, verbatim — and is what places the
# tag's card on the catalogue page. Admission and placement are one diff line;
# a card cannot appear in a section this file does not put it in.
#
# Generated first cut, then hand-edited. Re-check with:
#   tento-rebar check tento-ui-js
